WEBVTT

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.100
Sixteenth century Florence--

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.970
During this period, most commoners
didn't have stone ovens in their homes,

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.010
so they would either share ovens,

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:49.640
or bring their dough to
a bread baker to get it baked.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.680
Hey, it's done baking!

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.970
Who's waiting for four loaves?

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:57.100
Yes, here! Those are mine!

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.930
Oh, Miss, it's you!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:02.010
Did you try the leavening agent
I told you about last time?

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.510
Yes, I used it in today's dough!

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.970
Then, go back and have a taste!

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:08.350
I will!

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.220
Leo, I'm back.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:21.970
Oh. Then let's clean up before we eat.

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.760
Hey, Arte. Take this.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.060
Yes, sir.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:33.220
You... How did that happen?

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.930
I'm sorry!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.540
"Courtesan"

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:09.970
The other day,

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:14.640
when I got close to Leo,
my chest suddenly started hurting...

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.760
Since then, I've been feeling weird...

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:24.180
When my face just gets close to Leo's,
I start having trouble breathing...

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:29.640
And if our bodies touch just a little,
like earlier, I end up overreacting...

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.510
There were also times I got
in trouble for being in a daze...

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:37.560
Is there something wrong with me after all?

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:42.100
Here.

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:44.720
Oh, thank you very much.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.470
This tastes better than usual.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:56.350
Oh, the man at the bakery taught me
a trick to making the dough.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.720
I see.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.640
Yeah, it's good.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:04.060
Even when it's delicious, the sour look
on his face doesn't go away, huh?

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.470
Leo doesn't smile except
in extremely rare instances.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:13.310
On top of that, it's impossible to predict
when and at what he's going to smile.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:19.560
But maybe that's why I was so shaken
by that unexpected smile.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.510
So much that it made my chest hurt.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:26.470
I wonder if he'll smile again
like he did back then.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:30.720
If he does, then maybe I can figure out
why I've been feeling strange lately.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.350
Hey!

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.510
Can you hear me?

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:37.060
Huh? What? Were you saying something?!

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:40.060
I was talking about work.
After we finish eating, we're going out.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:40.890
Yes, sir!

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:43.560
Don't be so absentminded. Are you feeling ill?

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.850
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.010
I did it again...

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.810
A portrait?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:54.010
Yeah, there's a patron who's
a regular customer of mine.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.390
She often asks me for portraits.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.720
Oh...

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.640
You met her the other day.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:00.930
You know,

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.680
the courtesan you met during Carnival.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:11.640
Please wait a moment.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:20.260
Was she always rich?

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.350
No.

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:25.510
She's renting this house with the money
she makes from being a courtesan.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:26.720
What?!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.430
W-Wow...

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:32.390
Apparently, she's also supporting her mother
and young brother and sister.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.260
Really?

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.720
Leo!

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:37.890
Welcome.

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:40.100
I'm counting on you this time, too.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.810
Oh, my, how unusual!

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.560
What's going on? Bringing a girl with you...

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:47.100
She's--

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:53.510
A pleasure to make your acquaintance.
I'm his apprentice, Arte.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.310
Oh, my.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:59.680
It's hard to believe such a
well brought up girl is Leo's apprentice.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:03.600
I'm Veronica. Nice to meet you.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:06.930
This time, it's for a gentleman
who likes intelligent women.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:11.060
So I thought to use this study as a background

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:15.890
and either hold a book
or spread it out on my lap.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.100
Is something wrong?

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:21.390
Huh? Oh, it's just... I was thinking
that you had so many books.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:24.850
Education is also required in order
to entertain gentlemen,

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.510
so I have read all the books here.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.810
W-Wow...!

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.180
What an interesting girl.

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.010
Huh?!

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:39.060
Oh, but wasn't the apprentice you
had with you the other day a boy?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.390
This is the same apprentice.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:53.850
Oh, dear, you had me completely fooled!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.060
When I look at her again,

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:02.640
I can see that she's really beautiful
and has lovely expressions.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:07.560
You look very interested in this study.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.890
Would you like to borrow some books?

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:12.720
Huh? I-Is it really all right?

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.390
Thank you very much!

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:18.220
You said your name was Arte, right?

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.470
Yes!

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:23.390
You can't look at being a prostitute
with such sparkling eyes.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:27.760
Could it be that you're an innocent girl
who doesn't know what kind of work I do?

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:33.600
I-I think I probably know...
what kind of work it is...

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:40.720
But seeing this mountain of books,
I can't help but respect you.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:43.600
I'm not respecting your profession.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:47.390
I'm respecting your hard work.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.060
Leo.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:52.060
Yes?

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.390
I like this girl.

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:58.350
I want her to paint my portrait.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.600
What about the compensation?

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:03.180
I'll pay the usual amount
plus the cost of materials.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.970
Very well.

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:08.100
Arte, it's your first job.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.510
All right!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:17.350
It's my first time being requested for a job!

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:24.470
After that, I visited Veronica often
in order to paint her portrait.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.850
Veronica was kind even to me,
an apprentice painter,

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:32.560
and she held salons at her house
to entertain visiting gentlemen

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:35.350
with her wealth of knowledge
and gentle way of talking.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.510
She always had a book in her hand,

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:43.140
and whenever she had even
a little time, she would read.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:52.310
The more I knew about her,
the more I respected her and liked her.

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:54.810
Did you borrow another new book?

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:59.640
Yes, I did! All the books I borrow
from Veronica are so good!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:04.180
She chose all of them for me,
you know. Isn't it amazing?!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.680
Okay, okay.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:06.680
I'm well aware that you love Veronica.

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:08.720
How's progress going on the portrait?

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:10.890
Oh, right.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:16.890
She chose the one she liked from my sketches,
so I'm fine-tuning that now.

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:22.390
Oh, in order to show her more beautifully,
you shouldn't use lines like these.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:25.600
Again... my body won't move...

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.100
Breathe...

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:30.470
Make the background darker
so the subject can look livelier...

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:30.470
How do I breathe again...?

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:32.220
Hey, are you listening?!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.850
You've been slacking off recently.

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.760
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.470
Get serious about your work.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:50.310
You look down.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:52.850
Oh, no, I'm totally fine!

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:55.850
Sorry, did I seem down?

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:58.510
As you can see, I'm fine! Totally fine!

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:01.560
Arte...

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.470
If there's anything troubling you,
you can talk to me about it.

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:09.850
I love the cheerful you,
so you're making me feel sad, too.

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.890
Actually...

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:20.760
So you keep being unable to concentrate,
and then, Leo got angry with you?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.140
Is that what happened?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:27.010
Even though the problem is with me,
I don't know what to do...

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:32.390
When his hand touches you, your body gets hot.

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:36.720
You feel like you're suffocating,
and your heart hammers in your chest.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:39.470
How do you know all that?!

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:41.260
Arte...

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.180
That's love.

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:45.010
Huh?

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.640
L-Love...?

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.890
How cute.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:59.640
It's the first time she's been in love, huh?

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:05.640
But... for women like us trying to live
without the protection of a man,

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:10.310
love that makes you lose your head
is the first step to Hell, Arte.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:16.430
Wait, Veronica, I don't have time for this.
I won't be able to finish the portrait in time!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.970
Leo's going to get mad at me!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.810
It's fine, it's fine.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:22.140
I'll pay to compensate for it.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:22.850
Come now!

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.850
That's...

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:29.310
Where are we going?

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:31.890
There's something I want to show you.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.140
We're here.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:41.310
Come on... It's fine, isn't it?

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.810
Oh, my.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:51.470
That person... Is she an old woman...?
No, she's still young...

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:55.600
She was once a high-class prostitute, like me.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:59.850
She used to be so, so beautiful.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:04.260
She had glossy hair that she
took good care of, white skin,

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:08.350
and clothed her body in resplendent
clothes of the latest fashions.

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:14.850
But now, she takes whatever customers
are given to her and gets paid by the day.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.970
Why did she end up like this...?

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:19.680
Because she fell in love.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.760
She fell in love with a man,

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.140
and became so crazy about him
that she forgot her work.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:29.720
One thing led to another, and she fell quickly.
Now, she's the lowest of the low.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.350
You're useless!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:37.260
Today's our weekly meat day.

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:40.180
Eat to your heart's content
and get your strength up.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:43.100
What's wrong? Hurry up
and eat. It'll get cold.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:49.140
Um... I'm not really hungry...
It's not that I'm sick or anything, though...

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:53.510
In any case, I'll just have this soup
and then head upstairs.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:57.920
"Upset"

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:58.100
He's giving off a really angry aura!

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:02.220
I'm sorry! You're right,
it would be a waste of food.

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.220
That's not it.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:07.430
Eating and sleeping properly
is also part of your job.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:11.100
If you're not sick, then eat it,
even if you have to force it down.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:14.310
If you're thinking about
tomorrow's work, that is.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.220
Work...

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:21.260
Arte, what is your dream?

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.890
My dream...?

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:29.760
Um, it's to be able to live
by my own power, on my own.

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.180
If you want to make your dream come true,

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:37.720
then you can't let yourself grow soft
because you're a woman and get distracted.

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:42.970
This world is cruel to women,
and no one knows what the future will hold.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:47.970
You don't have time to be preoccupied by love.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.810
She's right.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.510
This is no time to be thinking
about unnecessary things.

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:58.310
I need to focus on the job in front of me...

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.060
I need to do my best!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:11.350
Please wait in this room.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:13.140
Thank you very much.

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:28.930
Thank you for waiting, Miss Arte.
Mistress Veronica is ready to see you now.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.720
Huh?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.350
Me...?

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.810
Hello, Arte. Thanks for coming today, too.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:42.100
Is this all right? It looks like there was
someone here waiting before me...

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:44.310
Don't worry about him.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.100
I'm making him wait on purpose.

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:48.640
On purpose?

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.890
It's a technique I use a lot.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.010
I keep him away, playing hard to get,

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:56.890
so that he never gets to see me,
which makes him want to see me more.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:01.970
When he can finally see me,
he quickly becomes devoted to me.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:05.010
I supposed you can call it
part of the stratagems of love.

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:07.640
Now, let us begin.

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.850
I keep him away, playing hard to get...

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.760
...he quickly becomes devoted to me.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.220
People fall in love after having
that done to them, huh?

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:21.600
I don't really get it.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.970
That's love.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:27.060
I don't really get love yet, either.

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:31.310
My chest getting tight... my face getting hot...

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:34.430
Are those things love?

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:37.350
Was that man suffering, too?

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:42.060
To wait for hours with that pain in his chest...

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:45.010
He must have been suffering so much.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:49.260
No, no! I need to focus on work!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.720
Well then, I will summon you when she is ready.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.470
Again...

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:07.430
Um... You were here the
other day, too, weren't you?

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:12.060
Oh, I'm here to paint a portrait of Veronica--

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.680
A portrait?!

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:16.140
Who is it being sent to?!

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.890
A man who is not me?!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:18.620
Wai--

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.310
What does she think of me?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:23.680
Please, wait!

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:26.100
I-I'm sorry...

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:33.100
Even though I know there's no use asking you,
being here is slowly driving me crazy.

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:36.850
When I hear her laughing
while talking to other men,

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:40.350
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind with envy.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:46.970
Sorry about that. My previous
visitor just wouldn't leave...

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:48.220
Um...

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.140
Hm?

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:53.970
Is it okay to make people suffer
for the sake of your job?

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.850
Why are you asking that out of the blue?

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:59.640
You've been making that man wait
this whole time today, too, right?

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:01.350
Oh, is it about that?

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:05.470
I mean, that's the kind of job I have.

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:08.640
To be okay with letting people suffer...

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:12.310
I didn't think you were that
kind of person, Veronica.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.390
You can't look at being a prostitute
with such sparkling eyes.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:23.060
I told you back then, didn't I?

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:27.220
But... But anyway, I...

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:29.390
I don't think this is okay!

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.060
Excuse me!

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:49.680
I was charmed by that kind
smile this whole time...

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:53.810
Today was the first time
I thought that smile was scary.

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.760
Arte, how's your work going?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.100
Oh, right!

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.430
Let's see.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.350
What is it?

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.850
Nothing, don't mind me!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:10.140
Well, it's not bad.
You're doing good work.

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:11.720
Keep going and finish it off like this.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:15.930
Once you're done, I'll do a final check of the
details and make any modifications needed.

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:17.350
Yes, sir!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.850
I haven't been to Veronica's since then.

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:28.810
All that's left is to finish it up, anyway,
and I don't know how I should face her.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.640
I can't concentrate!

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:36.390
Oh, Miss! Welcome!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:38.010
Hello.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.350
What's the matter? You look down.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.140
How was the bread from the other day?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:46.810
Oh, the dough you taught me
to make was very delicious!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:51.640
Oh, is that right? I'm glad!

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:54.810
I don't bake bread every day for nothing!

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.760
You don't bake bread every day for nothing?

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.810
It's because you can't do anything
<i>but</i> bake bread, right?

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.970
What're you being so smug about?

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.720
Well, you got me there...

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:12.060
Apologize!

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:14.760
What's with this girl?

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:18.060
What's there to apologize about?
I just said what was true.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:21.760
Anyone can be a bread baker-- Ow, ow, ow...

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:24.260
It has nothing to do with his profession.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:28.760
I'm just respecting his hard work!

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:33.640
I'm respecting your hard work.

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:40.930
What the heck? What a weird girl.

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.060
Miss!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:46.970
Thanks.

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:53.140
Mister, how can you smile
after all that was said about you?

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:58.970
Huh? How? I can't act angry
in front of a customer.

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:04.100
No matter what gets said,
no matter what happens,

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:06.720
doing my job properly is a matter of pride.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:15.350
No matter what happens,
I need to do my job properly.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:18.140
Oh, you've made a lot of progress all at once.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.640
I guess...

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:23.140
All that's left is some fine tuning...

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.890
Do this... here...

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.510
So close...! He's too close!

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:29.810
B-But...

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.430
And here...

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.350
Hm? What is it?

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:40.430
She's back to her normal self.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.970
You've finally finished it!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:48.970
I was getting tired of waiting
for you to bring this.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:54.350
A gaze that conveys intelligence,
and a soft, kind smile.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.760
So this is how I look to you, huh?

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.510
It makes me happy.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:03.510
Thank you. It's wonderful.

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:07.970
Veronica's smile, which I hadn't seen
in a while, really was charming...

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.720
I felt like it was going to suck me in.

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:12.180
But...

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:18.260
I can't forgive you for making
someone suffer after all.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:28.760
But... I <i>do</i> respect all the work you've put into
being able to live through your own power.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:33.850
I think that's fine.
I like that about you.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:38.850
But how long do you plan
on keeping up that smile?

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:42.930
That's a hard question.

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:46.600
I'd like to say,
"When I quit this line of work,"

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:51.720
but it's a sinful profession, so it might
be until I'm on the verge of death.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.350
This is...

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:58.560
...her resolve.

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:02.470
Arte!

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:07.140
If you ever need anything, come find me anytime.

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.970
I'll be here to listen
whenever you need to talk.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.640
As a friend.

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.100
As a friend...

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:59.470
"Preview"

00:23:56.640 --> 00:24:00.100
I'm sure Leo had a training period, too!

00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:02.760
I was more hardworking than you.

00:24:02.760 --> 00:24:05.850
I'll work harder so he won't
say things like that!

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:11.050
"Inescapable Bond"

00:24:05.850 --> 00:24:07.640
Next time, "Inescapable Bond."

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:11.060
A customer who's known Leo for a long time?
